This is the final layer of the data architecture, where I have loaded the cleaned and organized data. The Gold layer specifies the fact and the dimension tables for the data modeling.
I have followed snake format of naming convention for naming the tables and the columns.
---------------------------------------------
FACT TABLE: fact_station_day
---------------------------------------------

CREATE VIEW clean_data.fact_station_day AS

SELECT 
StationID As station_id,
Date_ AS record_date,
PM2_5 AS pm2_5,
PM10 AS pm_10,
NO2 AS no_2,
NH3 AS nh_3,
CO AS co,
SO2 AS so_2,
O3 AS o_3,
Benzene AS benzene,
Toluene AS toluene,
Xylene AS xylene,
AQI AS aqi,
AQI_Bucket AS aqi_bucket
FROM data_cleaning.station_day;

